  "description": "Add-on IFileExtractor for Scrubkit that reads OpenDocument Format files — text documents (.odt), spreadsheets (.ods), and presentations (.odp) from LibreOffice / OpenOffice. Extracts the body text and the Title/Author/Subject properties, fully offline with no dependencies beyond Scrubkit.Abstractions. Register it via ReadOptions.Extractors.",
